<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela foreign reserves rise to $14.396 bln.</title>
<headline>Venezuela foreign reserves rise to $14.396 bln.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's foreign reserves rose $341 million, or 2.42 percent, to $14.396 billion in the week to November 4, according to figures released by the Central Bank.</p>
<p>Reserves were up from $14.055 on October 28, the bank's weekly bulletin of indicators showed.</p>
